# ShellMate Credentials
# =====================
# Copy this file to ~/.shellmate/.env or set these as environment variables.
# ShellMate will check ~/.shellmate/.env first, then environment variables.
#
# Required for full AI-powered analysis. Without them, ShellMate uses
# deterministic rule-based fallback mode only.
#
# To configure interactively, run:
#   shellmate configure


# 1. GROQ_API_KEY
# ----------------
# Used for: AI risk analysis of commands
# Get your key at: https://console.groq.com/keys
# (Free tier available - sign up at groq.com)
# GROQ_API_KEY=


# 2. OPENROUTER_API_KEY
# ----------------------
# Used for: AI remediation suggestions (safer command alternatives)
# Get your key at: https://openrouter.ai/keys
# (Provides access to multiple models via one API)
# OPENROUTER_API_KEY=


# 3. CONTEXT7_API_KEY
# --------------------
# Used for: Documentation lookup for command flags and options
# Get your key at: https://context7.com
# (Optional - enhances documentation suggestions)
# CONTEXT7_API_KEY=
